"启动训练以后，ms-swift 会不断输出当前的训练信息，如下：":"Once training starts, ms-swift keeps printing the current training information, as below:",
"LoRA 训练完成以后，会保存对应的 LoRA Adapter。Adapter 并不是一个完整的大模型，因此在使用时还需要加载原来的基础模型，通过训练脚本中的 output_dir，可以在目录中看到的 checkpoint 以及对应的 Adapter 文件，在实际部署时，可以将 LoRA Adapter 合并到基础模型中，生成一个完整的模型，在离线部署或模型迁移时更加方便。模型训练完成后的目录形式如下：":"After LoRA training finishes, the corresponding LoRA Adapter is saved. An Adapter is not a complete large model, so using it still requires loading the original base model; through the output_dir in the training script you can see the checkpoint and the corresponding Adapter files. In real deployment you can merge the LoRA Adapter into the base model to produce a complete model, which is more convenient for offline deployment or model migration. The directory after training looks like this:",
"模型合并命令如下：":"The model merge command is as follows:",
"其中，--adapters 指定训练得到的 LoRA checkpoint 路径，--merge_lora true 表示将 LoRA 参数合并到基础模型中，--output_dir 指定合并后模型的保存目录。":"Where <code>--adapters</code> gives the path of the trained LoRA checkpoint, <code>--merge_lora true</code> merges the LoRA parameters into the base model, and <code>--output_dir</code> gives the directory for the merged model.",
"执行结果如下：":"The result is as follows:",
"合并完成后，可以直接加载生成的完整模型进行推理。为了方便应用程序调用，也可以将模型启动为 OpenAI 兼容接口，通过 API 的方式访问微调后的模型。由于 swift deploy 启动的是一个持续运行的常驻服务，不会执行完就退出，如果直接在 Notebook 单元格里前台运行，它会一直占用内核，导致后续的请求测试单元格无法执行。因此需要在终端中启动，让服务在后台持续运行，同时在 Notebook 里发送请求。在魔搭 Notebook 中，终端位于 WebIDE 的面板（Panel）里，可以通过右上角的面板图标或 Ctrl+J 快捷键唤起。启动命令如下：":"After merging you can load the complete model directly for inference. To make it easy for applications to call, you can also start the model as an OpenAI-compatible endpoint and reach the fine-tuned model through the API. Because <code>swift deploy</code> starts a long-running service that does not exit when finished, running it in the foreground inside a Notebook cell would occupy the kernel and block later request-testing cells. So start it in the terminal so the service runs in the background, and send requests from the Notebook. In a ModelScope Notebook the terminal lives in the WebIDE Panel and can be opened with the panel icon in the top right or the <code>Ctrl+J</code> shortcut. The start command is as follows:",
