"这里的训练规模较小，主要用于演示完整流程。训练步骤表示优化器更新参数的次数，不等于训练轮数，也不表示训练数据已经全部使用一遍。本次实操部分仅使用了较小部分的数据，并采用了较少次数的迭代步骤，实验仅作参考。":"The scale here is small, mainly to demonstrate the full flow. Training steps mean how many times the optimiser updates the parameters, which is not the number of epochs and does not mean the whole training set has been used once. This hands-on section uses only a small part of the data and few iteration steps, so the experiment is for reference only.",
