"本文以产线巡检为例，介绍了如何使用 Penguin Harness 开发完整的 Agent 应用，并通过实际案例演示了应用的使用效果。在此基础上，我们又让 Penguin Harness 对应用进行评测与优化，并通过测试验证了优化后应用在产线巡检任务上的表现提升。":"Taking line inspection as the example, this article showed how to use Penguin Harness to develop a complete agent application and demonstrated the result through a real case. On that basis we had Penguin Harness evaluate and optimise the application, and verified through testing that the optimised application performed better on the line-inspection task.",
"对于其他业务场景，也可以按照这一流程，用 Penguin Harness 开发适合自身业务需求的 Agent 应用。":"For other business scenarios you can follow the same process to develop an agent application with Penguin Harness that fits your own business needs.",
